  "description": "Seven and Silva Ajamu witness the deaths of their father and grandfather by the hands of Arthur Grove. They are saved by Viktor Espinoza a former soldier who raises them as his own. Viktor must teach the boys how to harness their power before its too late. Meanwhile, Grove has a dark energy brewing inside him that can alter the balance of Primordia as we know it. Can the brothers work together and unlock their full potential?",
